{"requirements": [
    {
        "id": 1,
        "text": "A dice-throwing game for three players."
    },
    {
        "id": 2,
        "text": "Every player starts with 0 points."
    },
    {
        "id": 3,
        "text": "The players take turns."
    },
    {
        "id": 4,
        "text": "In each turn, a player must throw a dice."
    },
    {
        "id": 5,
        "text": "The dice count gets added to the player's points."
    },
    {
        "id": 6,
        "text": "After each turn, the system prints the dice count and the player points."
    },
    {
        "id": 7,
        "text": "The game ends after 12 turns."
    },
    {
        "id": 8,
        "text": "The game also terminates if one player has significantly more points than the others."
    },
    {
        "id": 9,
        "text": "If and only if the dice count is 1, it must be decided if the player re-rolls the dice instead."
    },
    {
        "id": 10,
        "text": "There will be some sort of congratulations for the winner."
    },
    {
        "id": 11,
        "text": "The player point colors shall always be red, green, and blue for player 1, player 2, and player 3 respectively."
    },
    {
        "id": 12,
        "text": "If a player's points are sufficient to win, his point color shall turn purple."
    },
    {
        "id": 13,
        "text": "If the current player throws a 6, his turn must not continue."
    },
    {
        "id": 14,
        "text": "If the dice count is 2, it shall be tripled. If the dice count is even, it shall be halved."
    },
    {
        "id": 15,
        "text": "The game shall check the players' points at any point in the game. If they turn equal, it shall print: \"Equality!\"."
    },
    {
        "id": 16,
        "text": "The players' turn order must be decided at the beginning of the game."
    },
    {
        "id": 17,
        "text": "Names shall be entered for each player. If the name is \"Computer\", the system shall print \"Name cannot be Computer\" and ask for the name again."
    },
    {
        "id": 18,
        "text": "If the dice count is high, throw again and multiply both dice counts."
    },
    {
        "id": 19,
        "text": "When a player's points get above 5 points, his point color shall turn purple."
    },
    {
        "id": 20,
        "text": "In each turn, the player could skip his turn."
    },
    {
        "id": 21,
        "text": "If a player throws the same value multiple times in a row, his points are reset to 0."
    },
    {
        "id": 22,
        "text": "If two players have the same amount of points, the game cannot end until one player has more points than the other."
    },
    {
        "id": 23,
        "text": "If needed, the system can print the players' points and the winner after a game has ended."
    },
    {
        "id": 24,
        "text": "After the game has ended, one player shall be the winner."
    },
    {
        "id": 25,
        "text": "If the players decide to play again, instead of choosing the player order randomly, the players shall be ordered in a certain way."
    }
]}
